---
// Founding-donor call-to-action band (Home + Get Involved).
---

<section class="band">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Help us formally launch the foundation</h2>
    <p>
      Founding donors ($1,000+) start the institution itself: incorporating the
      New Bill of Rights Foundation, filing for 501(c)(3) status, and seating
      the founding board — on which every founding donor serves for at least a
      year.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a class="cta" href="/get-involved/seed-donors">Become a founding donor</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .band {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    padding-block: var(--space-4);
    margin-block: var(--space-4);
  }

  .band h2,
  .band p {
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  /* paper-on-ink: 13.5:1 — gold-on-ink text would only hit 3.9:1 */
  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }

  .cta:hover {
    background: var(--band);
  }
</style>
